SUMMARY:Let's Film AVL Brainstorming Session
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Filmmakers and Actors Group\nCome brainstorm with us
 !\n\nWe'll toss ideas around\, play some story improvisation games\, and w
 ork together to come up with an exciting\, feasible idea for a short film 
 to be shot in the Asheville area.\n\nAll creatives or interested parties w
 elcome - no résumé or experience required!\n\nHappens on the second Sund
 ay of every month. (typically)
